{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8xOTkwLS1CZWZvcmUvQ2hhbWVsaSUyMEtpJTIwU2hhYWRpJTIwJTI4MTk4NiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Chameli Ki Shaadi","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/63oQbEExYTafwNqphV58b2F2cjW.jpg","description":"Charandas, a young man in a village has no aim in life except to be a pehelwaan (wrestler). He takes an oath that he will not court or marry a girl until he hits the age of forty. But things changes when Charandas meets Chameli and falls in love with her. A hilarious take on the caste system of India, as both of them come from different castes and try hard to marry each other.","releaseInfo":"1986","genres":["Comedy","Drama","Romance","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.8","runtime":"137 min","cast":["Anil Kapoor","Amrita Singh","Amjad Khan","Om Prakash","Bharati Achrekar","Annu Kapoor","Ram Sethi","Jayshree Talpade"],"director":["Basu Chatterjee"],"released":"1986-02-21T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Anil Kapoor","character":"Charandas","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dwvnpiwg9m2zj0VHzlgzEotFl0G.jpg"},{"name":"Amrita Singh","character":"Chameli","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yzGYLwPUvn5ksdisC0L4bQiLTNj.jpg"},{"name":"Amjad Khan","character":"Adv. Harish","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/52s7Cbukn505Bo0JzLdurF8RXb.jpg"},{"name":"Om Prakash","character":"Ustad Mastram Pahelwan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5yUA7sreaD2xYLSvEwpSADJ2M1Y.jpg"},{"name":"Bharati Achrekar","character":"Champa, Chameli's Mother","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8bn9lW8gBj4kmVMlTutgpSzYUQj.jpg"},{"name":"Annu Kapoor","character":"Chhadam Lal / Chhadami","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jeWOeGZYWHAvP3fwSgPyozOyW80.jpg"},{"name":"Ram Sethi","character":"Nathulal","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/d9RaIzBFMcOj5Q2ygaknYu9vlvd.jpg"},{"name":"Jayshree Talpade","character":"Gulabo, Nathulal's Wife","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/f8AgumMnWKsb01YgJ